# CODEOWNERS — domain-split ownership (SR-213)
#
# Each domain routes to a GitHub team so contract-code, infra, backend, and
# frontend review land with the right reviewers instead of a single handle.
# Teams live under the Haroldwonder org; until a team has members its rule
# still resolves (GitHub falls back to the next matching rule / the `*`
# fallback), so adding people later needs no CODEOWNERS change.
#
# Team → domain map and the branch-protection requirements are documented in
# .github/CODEOWNERS_POLICY.md. Keep the two files in sync.
#
# Ordering: later matches win, so the wildcard fallback comes first and the
# most specific paths come last.

# ── Fallback ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*                           @Haroldwonder/maintainers @Haroldwonder

# ── Smart contract (Soroban / Rust) ─────────────────────────────────────────
/src/                       @Haroldwonder/contract-team
/tests/                     @Haroldwonder/contract-team
/fuzz/                      @Haroldwonder/contract-team
/benches/                   @Haroldwonder/contract-team
/Cargo.toml                 @Haroldwonder/contract-team
/Cargo.lock                 @Haroldwonder/contract-team
/rust-toolchain.toml        @Haroldwonder/contract-team

# ── Backend / API / SDK services ────────────────────────────────────────────
/api/                       @Haroldwonder/backend-team
/backend/                   @Haroldwonder/backend-team
/sdk/                       @Haroldwonder/backend-team

# ── Frontend & mobile ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/frontend/                  @Haroldwonder/frontend-team
/mobile/                    @Haroldwonder/frontend-team

# ── Infrastructure / CI / deploy / observability ───────────────────────────
/charts/                    @Haroldwonder/infra-team
/monitoring/                @Haroldwonder/infra-team
/scripts/                   @Haroldwonder/infra-team
/docker-compose.yml         @Haroldwonder/infra-team
/docker-compose.override.yml @Haroldwonder/infra-team
/.github/                   @Haroldwonder/infra-team
/.github/workflows/         @Haroldwonder/infra-team

# ── Docs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/docs/                      @Haroldwonder/maintainers
/README.md                  @Haroldwonder/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md             @Haroldwonder/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                @Haroldwonder/maintainers

# CODEOWNERS itself and other org-governance files stay with maintainers.
/.github/CODEOWNERS          @Haroldwonder/maintainers
/.github/CODEOWNERS_POLICY.md @Haroldwonder/maintainers
